dramratebench: SUSTAINED RATE -- N readers, 1048576 B each, ONE channel
  readers   aggregate B/cycle   per reader   aggregate GB/s   fanchan B/cycle
  No published table applies: wh_dram#performance is a WORMHOLE page, and this
  part is blackhole. Blackhole publishes no DRAM tile page at all -- no per-channel
  rate, no address map -- so there is nothing here to compare against and
  nothing measured here can supply it.
